# This file defines code ownership for automatic review requests
# Learn more: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners for everything in the repo
# These users will be requested for review when someone opens a pull request
*       @your-org/core-team

# Documentation
/docs/                  @your-org/docs-team
*.md                    @your-org/docs-team

# GitHub Actions and CI/CD
/.github/workflows/     @your-org/devops-team
/.github/actions/       @your-org/devops-team

# Build and configuration files
package.json            @your-org/core-team
package-lock.json       @your-org/core-team
tsconfig.json           @your-org/core-team
.eslintrc.*             @your-org/core-team
.prettierrc.*           @your-org/core-team

# Source code (customize based on your project structure)
# /src/                 @your-org/developers
# /src/api/             @your-org/backend-team
# /src/ui/              @your-org/frontend-team
# *.js                  @your-org/js-developers
# *.ts                  @your-org/ts-developers
# *.py                  @your-org/python-team

# Tests
# /test/                @your-org/qa-team
# *.test.js             @your-org/qa-team
# *.spec.js             @your-org/qa-team

# Security-sensitive files
SECURITY.md             @your-org/security-team
/.github/workflows/     @your-org/security-team @your-org/devops-team
